@startuml
!include ../theme.puml
title L4 受控执行层组件图
left to right direction

rectangle "L3 ToolExecutionGuard" as L3 LC_EXTERNAL
package "L4 Execution Runtime" LC_ADAPTER {
  component "ToolProviderAdapter" as PROVIDER
  component "SandboxRuntime" as SANDBOX
}
rectangle "业务 Tool Provider / MCP" as TOOL_PROVIDER LC_EXTERNAL
rectangle "Process / Container / Filesystem / Network Ports" as PROCESS LC_INFRASTRUCTURE
rectangle "Operations Plane" as OPS LC_OPERATIONS

L3 --> PROVIDER : ToolProviderPort
L3 --> SANDBOX : SandboxPort.execute\n一次性有界请求
PROVIDER --> TOOL_PROVIDER : Provider 私有协议
SANDBOX --> PROCESS : 机制 Port
PROVIDER ..> L3 : ToolResult
SANDBOX ..> L3 : SandboxedExecutionResult
PROVIDER ..> OPS : BND-OPS-001
SANDBOX ..> OPS : BND-OPS-001

note bottom of SANDBOX
  L4 定义受控执行语义；Infrastructure 只实现机制。
  Sandbox 不路由工具、不签发权限、不扩大 Permit。
end note
@enduml
